## Table: `external_booking_passengers`

**Purpose:** Passenger detail rows for `external_bookings` (parallel to `booking_passengers`).

**Columns:**
- `passenger_id` (int8, PRIMARY KEY, identity)
- `external_booking_id` (int8, FOREIGN KEY) - References `external_bookings.external_booking_id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `full_name` (text, NOT NULL)
- `age` (int4, nullable)
- `gender` (text, nullable)
- `passport_number` (text, nullable)
- `emergency_contact_name`, `emergency_contact_phone` (text, nullable)
- `dietary_restrictions`, `medical_conditions` (text, nullable)
- `created_at` (timestamptz)

**Relationships:**
- `external_booking_id` → `external_bookings.external_booking_id` (many-to-one)

