## Table: `external_payments`

**Purpose:** Payment records for external bookings (parallel to `payments` for local `booking`).

**Columns:**
- `payment_id` (int8, PRIMARY KEY, identity)
- `external_booking_id` (int8, FOREIGN KEY) - References `external_bookings.external_booking_id` ON DELETE CASCADE
- `amount` (numeric, NOT NULL, > 0)
- `currency` (text, NOT NULL, default `PKR`)
- `payment_method` (text, nullable)
- `payment_status` (text, NOT NULL, default `completed`)
- `transaction_id` (text, nullable, unique when present)
- `payment_date` (timestamptz, nullable)
- `refunded_at` (timestamptz, nullable)
- `refund_amount` (numeric, nullable)
- `payment_details` (jsonb, nullable)
- `created_at`, `updated_at` (timestamptz)

**Relationships:**
- `external_booking_id` → `external_bookings.external_booking_id` (many-to-one)

