## Query Examples

### Get user profile with role
```python
# Get profile
profile = supabase.table("profiles").select("*").eq("id", user_id).execute()

# Check if agent
agent = supabase.table("travel_agent").select("*").eq("user_id", user_id).execute()
role = "agent" if agent.data else "traveler"
```

### Get user's bookings with trip details
```python
bookings = supabase.table("booking")\
    .select("*, trips(*), itinerary(*), booking_passengers(*), payments(*)")\
    .eq("user_id", user_id)\
    .execute()
```

### Get booking with all related data
```python
booking = supabase.table("booking")\
    .select("*, trips(*), booking_passengers(*), payments(*), booking_notifications(*)")\
    .eq("booking_id", booking_id)\
    .execute()
```

### Get payments for a booking
```python
payments = supabase.table("payments")\
    .select("*")\
    .eq("booking_id", booking_id)\
    .order("created_at", desc=True)\
    .execute()
```

### Get agent's trips
```python
trips = supabase.table("trips")\
    .select("*")\
    .eq("agent_id", agent_id)\
    .execute()
```

### Get available trips with agent information
```python
trips = supabase.table("trips")\
    .select("*, travel_agent(*)")\
    .gt("available_seats", 0)\
    .execute()
```

### Get trip recommendations with user details
```python
recommendations = supabase.table("recommendation")\
    .select("*, trips(*), profiles(username)")\
    .eq("trip_id", trip_id)\
    .execute()
```

